Boundary notes:
  sailpoint = IGA (Identity Governance and Administration). Certifications, lifecycle,
  roles, SOD, provisioning, IdentityAI, access requests. NOT an IdP.
  Authentication/SSO/MFA routes to the relevant IdP skill (okta, ping-identity,
  entra-id, keycloak). Conceptual/selection layer routes to identity-access-management.
  Credential custody routes to secrets-hygiene. Deadline/expiry reasoning routes to
  utc-timestamps. SailPoint always works alongside an IdP, not instead of one.

